\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prolog] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >F<Amoso ac florenti studio eiusque sacre vniuersitati Insignite ciuitatis Auinionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Johannes Raynaudi legum doctor inter ceteros minimus... - qui aliquod opus perficiet quod erit omnibus fructuosum scriptum Marsilie dominice incarnationis M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  xviij die iiij Aprilis. Explicit Epistola. Incipit tractatus dictus comprehensorium feudale,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >I<Mperialem decet solertiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis patris et filij et spiritus sancti. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec constitutio situata est in libro feudorum collectorum iio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - que omnia subicio correctioni in melius sentientis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Inhaltsverzeichnis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Imperialis Rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... , (115va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt questiones comprehensorij feudalis domini Raymundi que sunt numero \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 223. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gratias.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Druck: Jean REGNAUD, Comprehensorium feudale, Lyon 1561. Auch vorhanden in Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. 5063, 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. DOLEZALEK, Verzeichnis: Iohannes Raynaldus/Raymundus, Repetitio ad constitutionum Frederici I, Wien \u214 \'d6NB, 5063, 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zum Autor vgl. G. GIORDANENGO, Les feudistes (XII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -XV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  s.), in: El dret com\u250 \'fa i Catalunya. Actes del II.\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 on\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Simposi Internacional, Barcelona, 31 maig - 1 juny de 1991, hrsg. v. A. I. Ferreir\u243 \'f3s, Barcelona 1992 (Estudis Fundaci\u243 \'f3 Noguera 3), S. 131 f. 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

