\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De terra sancta cur eam dominus variis flagellis ... exposuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >T<erra sancta promissionis deo et sanctis angelis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ..., (306\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De variis generibus malorum et bonorum que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [terram] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sanctam inhabitant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < (306\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer, offenbar ohne Textverlust, (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Qualiter a duce Arabum nomine Homar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= Umar] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 descriptio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Machamuti occupata terra sancta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <, (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De Machametis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [am Rand: Machameto] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in generali<,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De origine et vita Machameti<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De exerab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 li lege et errore Machameti<,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (314\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De morte Machameti<, ... - inter alios optinet principatum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kurze historische Beschreibung des heiligen Landes, Lebensbeschreibung des Muhammad, seine Lehre, sein Tod.}

