\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >G<loriosus doctor Sanctus Thomas ut documenta summe ..., Epistola exhortatoria Sancti Thome ad quendam in qua proponit ydoneum modum sabubriter ..., Incipit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Q<Via quesiuisti a me qualiter te studere oporteat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  Tua existit ea sectari vale et nisibus totis virtutibus incumbe ...
