\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus Laurentij Wallensis oratoris clarissimi de libero arbitrio et prouidentia diuina. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >T<Res modi nimis perplexi [!] nexu se inuicem complicant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - procedentem grauiter peccantes offendunt. Finitum Anno domini 1478.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Diese Fassung auch vorhanden in M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 107}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. DANIEL/ KORNRUMPF/SCHOTT, M\u252 \'fcnchen UB 3,1, S.173. Druck: HAIN, 8801.}

