\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Am Rand nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In capitulo Erffordie anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [14]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 85 in monte sancti Petri Egidij festo in die augusti per Reverendum patrem Abbatem Guntherum habita collacio. Incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [Text] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nos scimus ... (I Io 3,14). Prestantissimi patres et domini mei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Radix et fundamentum beatitudinis consequende ... \endash  Quod nobis omnibus concedere dignetur Jhesus Christus ... Amen.
