\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (320\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) alphabetisches Kapitelverzeichnis; (321\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -356\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit liber qui intitulatur scintille sacre scripture. De caritate Capitulum primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >C<Aritas patiens est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Caritatem fraternitatis inuicem diligite}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - interior homo nutritur et pascitur;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Druck: CCSL 117, 1-234; Defensor de Ligug\u233 \'e9, Livre d\rquote Etincelles, hrsg. v. H.-M. ROCHAIS, 2 Bde, Paris 1961-1962 (Sources chr\u233 \'e9tiennes 77.86); Prolog fehlt; CCSL Kap. 36 vor 35; Kap. 42 (De voluntatibus) fehlt; Kap. 53 (De pulchritudine) angeh\u228 \'e4ngt an Kap. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lj\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; nach Kap. 54 eingef\u252 \'fcgt: (344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De his qui mundi huius amore rapiuntur liij<, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >M<ulti cupiunt conuolare ad graciam dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  .. . - in eternum igne cruciari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Kap. 75 (De legatione) fehlt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 STEGM\u220 \'dcLLER, RB, Nr. 5813}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; H.-M. ROCHAIS, Les manuscrits du \u8222 \'84Liber scintillarum\ldblquote , Scriptorium 4 (1950), S.294-309; H.-M. ROCHAIS, Defensoriana. Arch\u233 \'e9ologie de \u8222 \'84Liber scintillarum\ldblquote , Sacris erudiri 9 (1957), S.199-264, ohne diese Hs.; DEKKERS, Nr.1302; BLOOMFIELD, Incipits, Nr.1506; 1761.
