\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit epistola Iohannis abbatis ducis ab Raythu ad admirabilem Iohannem montis Synay abbatem cognominatum Scholasticum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<vpermirabili equali angelo patri patrum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - vale in domino reverendissime pater;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Responsiua epistola Iohannis Scolastici dicti Climaci abbatis montis Synay ad Iohannem abbatem Raythu<, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >I<Ohannes Iohanni gaudere. Suscepi ita convenientem pudice tuo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - et propositi deus mercedes retribuit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Griechischer Text: PG 88, Sp. 624-628. Druck dieser \u220 \'dcbersetzung in der Ausgabe der Enarrationes in scalam paradisi Johannis Climaci des Dionysius Cartusianus: Dionysii Cartusiani Opera omnia, Tom. 28, Tournai 1905, S.13-18, vgl. MECKELNBORG, Koblenz LA I, S.187 zu Best. 701 Nr.131, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , dort weitere Sekund\u228 \'e4rliteratur. GEERARD, CPG, Nr.7850. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung s. Nr.3.}

