\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Bibelverse], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >uox divine consolationis<, Venite ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Mt 11,28), etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Scala peccatorum<, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Primus gradus est humilitas<}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Amans humilitatem radicem humilitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (12 gradus, daran jeweils ein \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jaculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 - proximo sua bona ita nec commitat [!] ei bona sua. Explicit ascensus graduum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scale peccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Die folgenden 5 Zeilen ohne Bezug zum anschlie\u223 \'dfenden Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur de alijs tironis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [!] ...}

