\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De collectione herbarum et confectione in quolibet mense<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Ypocras in suo Mecenato dixit: >M<ementote cauere ad colligendas herbas et conficiendas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >I<n Januario collige coconillos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... et debito modo desiccare et in debitis locis seruare.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Von Hand 2 geschrieben. Text: E. WICKERSHEIMER, Epistola Ypocratis ad Alexandrum de tempore herbarum, Janus 41 (1937), S. 145-152, hier S. 147 f. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 THORNDIKE/KIBRE, Sp. 865, Nr. 6}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; P. KIBRE, Hippocrates Latinus: Repertorium of Hippocratic Writings in the Latin Middle Ages (V), Traditio 35 (1979), S. 273-302, hier Nr. XXVIII, S. 300 f., ohne diese Hs. Daran: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >de melle<, >M<el ponitur pro zuccara ... Et coque ... donec succus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conseruas. Frigide herbe sunt sicud portulaca semperviua lactuca et quedam alie.}

