\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Niccol\u242 \'f2 Falcucci}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones medicinales}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo II: De febribus,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig.  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Sermo II ist mehrfach unterteilt, die Abschnittz\u228 \'e4hlung in der Hs, fehlerhaft. Da die Abschnitte sich gelegentlich verselbst\u228 \'e4ndigt haben, werden sie hier einzeln aufgef\u252 \'fchrt:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ncipit sermo secundus qui est de vniversali curacione morborum et de dispositionibus febrium et consequentium ad eas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prolog] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [P]Ostquam ego Nicolus [!] gratia dei expeditus sum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Kapitelverzeichnis f\u252 \'fcr tract. 1, summa 1 und summa 2]; (1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 1, summa 1] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [A]Ctus curatiuus tripliciter ab autoribus dicitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [25 Kap.]; (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 1, summa 2] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [P]Otio quid sit et quomodo distinguatur generaliter in actum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [28 Kap.]; (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vtinam exemplar fuisset correctum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, summa 1] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [F]Ebris apud plures sapientum dicitur a ferueo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ponitur prima 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de cura putridarum in generali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [32 Kap.], dieser Abschnitt ersetzt in GW 9705 durch einen anderen Text, vgl. aber HAGENMAIER, Freiburg I/1, S. 172 f. zu Hs. 223, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, Summa 2] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [A]Vtores tractantes de febribus incipiunt ab effimeris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [38 Kap.]; (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et ego Ludolphus Borchtorp de Brunswik\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [nachtr\u228 \'e4glich eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 artium magister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 presentem partem Nicoli Florentini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de vniversali curationis morborum et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de febribus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et scripsi Padue ex exemplari ... usque in finem totius non scripsi sed pro ea scripsi in Perusio magistro Augustino de Bodinis almano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Artium et medicine doctore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eandem partem in carta mediana viginti duorum sexternorum et sic videtur quod satis preciose ademi istam partem residuam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 3; diese Lage geh\u246 \'f6rt an den Schlu\u223 \'df der Hs.] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [C]Risim dicunt Greci id quod Latini judicium vocant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - scias materiam esse multam et necessariam fore euacuacionem. sequitur tractatus quartus sermonis secundi que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 erit de diebus creticis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Tract. 4 fehlt in der Hs.]; (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [leer]; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, summa 3] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<Thys [!] Grece Latine habitudo et hinc dixit Auicenna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... [12 Kap.]; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic tres carte de istis deficiunt secundum quod magister Lucas de Perusio michi retulit ... ex quo scilicet libro clam destino michi ... illa que sequuntur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Dieser Eintrag durchgestrichen, darunter:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hunc defectum ego Ludolfus suprascriptus Padue suppleui ideoque ut nichil deficit; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [leer]; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, summa 4, dist. 1] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [F]Ebris humoralis dicitur talis a subiecto in quo accensus est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [34 Kap.];\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  finitus per me Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [! vermutlich auf radiertem Albertum Rosenbom] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alias de Monte ... M\u176 \'b0cccc\u176 \'b0xx\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [urspr\u252 \'fcnglich vermutlich MCCCCXXXIX, am\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ende der Jahreszahl eine radierte Fl\u228 \'e4che], in den z. T. unleserlich gemachten\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Bemerkungen \u252 \'fcber die Umst\u228 \'e4nde der Abschrift werden Magister Balthasar\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 und Perugia erw\u228 \'e4hnt; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [nachgetragene Rezepte]; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1448\u176 \'b0 currente hanc receptam dedit in Perusij M. Augustinus a quo hunc librum habui ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Has receptas M. Bartholomei de Sancta Sophia ne locus invenietur vacuus hec interposui Padue 1450 currente; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 summa 4, dist. 2] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >F<Ebris sanguinea siue de sanguine dicitur febris ebullitionis et feruida siue ignea}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [7 Kap.]; (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 finitus per me Albertum de Monte alias Rosenbon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 clericum Bremensis dioecesis de prouintia Holtsacie de opido Crempis 1439 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, summa 4, dist. 3] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [F]Ebris colerica frequenter ab autoribus absolute tertiana vocatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [12 Kap.]; (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per me Augustinum de Monte alias Bohem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bohemensis diocesis prouintie Bohem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 opido uero Crempis ... 1430\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , aus \u252 \'fcberschriebenem Albertum de\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Monte alias Rosenbom ... (s. o. 191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), wahrscheinlich urspr\u252 \'fcnglich 1439 anstatt\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1430; (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [leer]; (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, summa 4, dist. 4] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >F<Ebris flegmatica communiter ab autoribus cotidiana dicitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [8 Kap.]; (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1439 ... per Albertum Rosenbom alias de Monte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 summa 4, dist. 5], {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [F]Ebris melancolica quandoque absolute uocatur ab autoribus quartana}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [8 Kap.]; (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Colophon getilgt; Notiz von Ludolphus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Borchtorp (s. o. Geschichte) \u252 \'fcber den anschlie\u223 \'dfenden Abschnitt; (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, summa 4, dist. 6] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<vtores medicine sepe pestem siue pestilentiam sinonime accipiunt ad epidimiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [22 Kap.], vgl. K. SUDHOFF,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Pestschriften aus den ersten 150 Jahren nach der Epidemie des\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8222 \'84schwarzen Todes\ldblquote  1348, Teil V, SUDHOFFS Archiv 6 (1913), S. 313-379, hier S. 338-341; (255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1439 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Colophon am Schlu\u223 \'df radiert); (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Tract. 2, summa 4, dist. 7], {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >F<Ebrium compositio duplex est vna parte dicta est febrium compositio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [47 Kap.]; (285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1439 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Rasur] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Monte alias Rosenbon de opido Crempis de prouintia Bohem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [..., verbessert aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Holtsatia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ].
