\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequuntur septem {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 orationes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  passionis domini quo ad septem horas diei Et dic eas omni die<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >G<ratias tibi ago benedicte [nachtr\u228 \'e4glich eingef\u252 \'fcgt: mi] domine Ihesu Christe}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quia tu es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [nachtr\u228 \'e4glich eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deus meus et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 saluator meus vere Quia hora diei vespertina ... - ad beatorum gloriam merear pervenire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod nobis omnibus prestare dignetur dominus pater Ihesu Christi qui eum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ..., 7 Gebete mit gleichem Anfang. Auch Berlin, SBB-PK, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theol. lat. oct. 89}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lat. oct. 404}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , beide aus der Kartause Salvatorberg.
