\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur meditatio passionis domini composita per quendam eius discipulum in memoriam regis eterni et in solatium peccatorum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >G<ratias tibi ago ingenite clementissime pater domine deus meus qui tuo vnigenito filio non peperisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [13 Artikel, danach] (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Oratio de sacramentorum restauratione<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >C<onplanta me similitudini mortis tue}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De sepultura<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<ostremo domine sepeli me tecum in tuo monumento}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Oratio de resurrectione<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >R<ogo te domine per virtutem et gloriam tue resurrectionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Conclusio<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<cribe igitur dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe pretiosa vulnera tua}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - et tu solus in corde meo dulcescas. Amen.}

