\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit meditatio euisdem discipuli de aequisitione vite virtuose ad Laudem regis eterni<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >D<omine deus meus veni hodie per presenciam gratissime visitationis tue in animam meam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De acta beatitudinibus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De dono sapientie et virtute karitatis<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De dono intellectus et virtute fidei<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De dono consilij et virtute prudencie<;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De dono fortitudinis<;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De dono sciencie eum virtute temperantie<;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De dono pietatis et virtute conscientie<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De dono timoris et virtute spei< ... - et planctum dispone vitam meam... dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe Qui viuis ... >Expliciunt Medationes passionis domini<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!]. Daran:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Dum me iubes emigrare Ihesu care tunc appare}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tecum viuam perhenniter. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13v.).}

