\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Am oberen Rand von anderer Hand nachgetragen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber primus Aphorismorum domini Hypocratis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... Der vollst\u228 \'e4ndige Text des Hippocrates abschnittsweise\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 in Rot geschrieben, der Kommentar dazwischen in Schwarz. Die\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Aphorismen z. T. am Rand durchgez\u228 \'e4hlt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 V>Ita breuis< quo oportet in medicina libros amphoristica breuitate componere quia vita est breuis respectu temporis requisiti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ars vero longa< per inuentionem acquirendam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 > \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tempus autem acutum< Id est tempus operandi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ..., (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) p.1 , (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) p.2,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) p.3, (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -108r) p.4, (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) p.5, (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) p.6, (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 p.7, [187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >SI aliquid de inferioribus spissum egrediatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...<, ... -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  colera vero rubea contrarium solent incensa emitti. Expliciunt commenta Galieni super afforismos Ypocratis deo gratias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  am unteren Rand ein Doppel-F ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fredericus Franck}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ?).
