\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >CLARISSIMI VIRI LEONARDI ARETINI AD ELOQVENTISSIMVM VIRVM COLVTIVM FLORENTINVM PROHEMIVM IN TRANSLATIONE MAGNI BASILII INCIPIT \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prolog des Leonardo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Bruni] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<GO TIBI HVNC LIBRVM Ex media ut aiunt Grecia delegi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Text] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Magni Basilij quopacto gentilium libros}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...<, [3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >M<VLTA SVNT filij qu\u281 e me hortantur ad ea uobis consulenda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod uos non paciamini nunc cetera consilia aspernantes. finis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Am Rand rote\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 stichwortartige Angaben zum Inhalt und Digiti.
